<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank revises HK Telecom warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank revises HK Telecom warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, has revised the terms of its issue of 168 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$15.385     PREMIUM	 11 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.471	GEARING	 3.8x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   20.APR.98     DENOMINATION  4,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$18.10	PAY DATE	14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG     LISTING DATE  16.JUL.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
